WEBVTT

00:30:58.020 --> 00:31:00.546
AG: And there's the genius
of Adrienne's approach.

00:31:00.570 --> 00:31:03.142
Empathy training eased burnout
at the Cleveland Clinic,

00:31:03.166 --> 00:31:06.433
because it gave doctors
that deeper sense of control.

00:31:06.777 --> 00:31:09.056
It enabled them to have
the kinds of effective,

00:31:09.080 --> 00:31:12.080
caring conversations with patients
that they wanted to have.

00:31:13.030 --> 00:31:15.248
You may not work in healthcare,

00:31:15.272 --> 00:31:16.628
but you know what it's like

00:31:16.652 --> 00:31:19.746
to feel that your tasks
are spinning out of your control.

00:31:19.770 --> 00:31:21.770
And you can find small but meaningful ways

00:31:21.794 --> 00:31:24.336
to gain more control over your work,

00:31:24.360 --> 00:31:26.995
or to give that control to your employees.

00:31:27.019 --> 00:31:28.452
(Music)

00:31:28.476 --> 00:31:29.762
For an executive assistant,

00:31:29.786 --> 00:31:32.646
it might be some extra
flexibility in hours.